        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《Green Realm》 is a cozy third-person 3D puzzle adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexpected incident, you find yourself trapped inside a mysterious green digital world built from data, rules, and memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles or dangers here — only hidden patterns waiting to be discovered.<br>Broken paths, looping time, moonlit reflections, and secrets hidden among the stars... each space has its own unique rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, observe, and understand how this world works as you search for the exit hidden within each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey continues, you will gradually discover that this world may be more than just a digital illusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore ten unique spaces, find the way out, and uncover the truth about yourself.</strong></p>",
